{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t亞太經合組織領導人非正式會議即將在深圳舉行。有泰國學者認為，中國的發展正在成為泰國現代化的重要增量，他相信粵港澳大灣區與泰國有很大合作潛力。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：梁家奇\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T12:17:34.981407+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":77,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T11:53:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T23:38:44.671652+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T12:11:11.797763+00:00","content_hash":"a075560a95272567070f25004359d0d9095c9579c6dbccf2233fc029585cdecf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}